[00:40.00] Beata Maria
[00:42.55] You know I am a righteous man
[00:45.08] Of my virtue I am justly proud
[00:51.39] Beata Maria
[00:54.35] You know I'm so much purer than
[00:56.64] The common, vulgar, weak, licentious crowd
[01:02.44] Then tell me, Maria
[01:04.95] Why I see her dancing there
[01:07.94] Why her smoldering eyes still scorch my soul
[01:14.48] I feel her, I see her
[01:16.74] The sun caught in her raven hair
[01:19.41] Is blazing in me out of all control
[01:26.17] Like fire
[01:28.72] Hellfire
[01:30.92] This fire in my skin
[01:35.54] This burning desire
[01:39.96] Is turning me to sin
[01:47.37] It's not my fault
[01:49.39] I'm not to blame
[01:51.28] It is the gypsy girl
[01:52.82] The witch who sent this flame
[01:55.12] It's not my fault
[01:57.08] If in God's plan
[01:59.28] He made the devil so much
[02:00.70] Stronger than a man
[02:05.20] Protect me, Maria
[02:07.56] Don't let this siren cast her spell
[02:09.83] Don't let her fire sear my flesh and bone
[02:15.46] Destroy Esmeralda
[02:18.02] And let her taste the fires of Hell
[02:20.66] Or else let her be mine and mine alone
[02:27.55] Hellfire
[02:48.48] Dark fire
[02:50.67] Now gypsy, it's your turn
[02:55.26] Choose me or
[02:57.27] Your pyre
[02:59.86] Be mine or you will burn
[03:07.52] God have mercy on her
[03:13.21] God have mercy on me
[03:18.95] But she will be mine
[03:22.64] Or she will burn!
[03:35.98]
